 RAD  *  QUSLSPL API - SPLF0100                                       *
 RAD  * ============================================================= *
 RAD  *   >>PRE-COMPILER<<                                            *
 RAD  *                                                               *
 RAD  *     >>CRTCMD<<  CRTPF         FILE(&LI/&OB) +                 *
 RAD  *                               SRCFILE(&SL/&SF)  +             *
 RAD  *                               SRCMBR(&SM);                    *
 RAD  *                                                               *
 RAD  *     >>COMPILE<<                                               *
 RAD  *       >>PARM<<                MAXMBRS(1);                     *
 RAD  *       >>PARM<<                MBR(*FILE);                     *
 RAD  *       >>PARM<<                FILETYPE(*DATA);                *
 RAD  *     >>END-COMPILE<<                                           *
 RAD  *                                                               *
